Usage: pqc-scan probe ssh [OPTIONS] --port <PORT> <HOST>

Arguments:
  <HOST>  

Options:
      --port <PORT>              
      --allow-cidr <ALLOW_CIDR>  
      --out-dir <OUT_DIR>        
      --lang <LANG>              [default: en] [possible values: en, ja]
  -h, --help                     Print help
